From: Vylen Linux Team <wonkru-dev@proton.me>
Subject: [PATCH] install siconv tables under /usr/lib/siconv

Keep the historical cdrtools package path under /usr/lib/siconv and make
Schilytools search the same directory at runtime. Update each per-table
makefile, which has its own INSDIR setting.

--- a/libsiconv/tables/Makefile
+++ b/libsiconv/tables/Makefile
@@ -8,5 +8,5 @@
 ###########################################################################

-INSDIR=		share/lib/siconv
+INSDIR=		lib/siconv
 TARGET=		iso8859-1
 XMK_FILE=	\
